  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 21.69,
      "end": 26.79,
      "text": "One of my favorite things about being an epidemiologist is just the variety to the job."
    },
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.63,
      "text": "She really helped me with statistics, but more than that, she said, look you need to be a research assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.94,
      "end": 7.26,
      "text": "You need to get into the honors program."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.26,
      "end": 8.55,
      "text": "You need to be a teaching assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.55,
      "end": 11.35,
      "text": "Here are the things you need to do to go forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.35,
      "end": 14.55,
      "text": "And without her, I don't think I would have done well."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.55,
      "end": 18.06,
      "text": "I don't think I would have stayed in science."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.06,
      "end": 19.72,
      "text": "She really had a huge impact on my life."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.73,
      "end": 21.61,
      "text": "When I was thinking about a Ph.D."
    }
